modules        stress  base     128 n: files in one package
small-fns      stress  base    1024 n: small functions
huge-fns       stress  base    2048 n: statements in four functions
deep-nesting   stress  base      16 n: block and expression nesting depth
wide-enums     stress  base      64 n: enum variants and arms per match table
impls-traits   stress  base     128 n: types with four trait impls each (traits = n/8)
generics       stress  base     128 n: distinct generic instantiations
comptime       stress  base     128 n: comptime (prep) items with record types
data-tables    stress  base    2048 n: literal table elements
imports        stress  base     128 n: files importing five Core modules
call-chains    stress  base     256 n: call depth
errors         stress  base     128 n: fallible functions with propagation and recovery
diagnostics    stress  base     128 n: reported errors
strings        stress  base    1024 n: interpolation holes (64 literal bytes each)
fan-in         stress  base    1024 n: call sites into shared helpers
web            domain  base  125000 lines: web/backend service: models, repositories, routes, templates, queries, roles
game           domain  base  125000 lines: game: components and systems, AI state machines, wave tables, inventories, behaviors
cli            domain  base  125000 lines: CLI tool: argument parsing, commands, table output, configuration
data           domain  base  125000 lines: data analysis: columns, group-by, pipelines, CSV rows
gui            domain  base  125000 lines: GUI application: widgets and layout, reducers, styles, events
embedded       domain  base  125000 lines: embedded: registers and bit fields, ring buffers, CRC tables, framing state machines
compiler       domain  base  125000 lines: compiler/interpreter: lexers, ASTs and evaluators, stack VMs, type tables
scientific     domain  base  125000 lines: scientific/numeric: polynomials, quadrature, matrices, ODE steps
generic-lib    domain  base  125000 lines: generic-heavy library in one entry file: generic records and functions instantiated per model
generated      domain  base  125000 lines: generated code: message structs, registries, lookup tables, accessors
